<main class="story-page"><a class="story-back" href="/">← Back to home</a><article class="story-header"><p class="kicker">Get Connected / Privacy</p><h1>Privacy<br /><em>notice.</em></h1><p class="story-summary">This draft explains the information collected through the website enquiry form. Get Connected must review and approve it, including its contact details and retention policy, before launch.</p></article>
<section class="program-details"><h2>Information you submit</h2><p>The enquiry form asks for your name, email address, subject and message. Phone number is optional. The form also records your consent to use those details to respond.</p><h2>Why we use it</h2><p>Get Connected uses the information you submit to receive, review and respond to your enquiry.</p><h2>Who can access it</h2><p>Enquiry messages are intended for authorized Get Connected staff who handle website enquiries. They are not published on the public website.</p><h2>Retention and your requests</h2><p>Get Connected should define and publish a retention period, a contact for privacy questions, and a process for requesting access, correction or deletion before this notice is approved.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, use the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>. The organization must confirm its official privacy contact before this notice is published.</p></section>
</main>
